{# Reusable article-preview card — square art (an image, or the Tico
   logomark as a default) plus a subtitle, linking to the full piece.
   Currently only used for the /research/ whitepaper; written generic
   (href/image/subtitle all overridable) so if this becomes a real
   multi-post blog later, each entry can set its own values before
   including this rather than needing a new component. Set
   `articleCardHref` / `articleCardImage` / `articleCardSubtitle` before
   including to override the defaults. #}
<a href="{{ articleCardHref or '/research/' }}" class="article-card">
  <span class="article-card__art">
    <img src="{{ articleCardImage or '/assets/images/tico-logomark.png' }}" alt="" class="article-card__image">
  </span>
  <p class="article-card__subtitle">
    {{ articleCardSubtitle or "How to \"make every ticket count\" with Tico — the research behind why service quality drives repeat visits." }}
  </p>
</a>
